{ This system used to be played mainly with the idea to pin the knight on c6 and then take it, develop with Nc3, Bg5 and castle long. Nowadays, some top players started playing it with different ideas, like dropping the queen back to e3 and simply finishing the development. It is not that dangerous. In particular for players who aren't that experienced and want to improve their game, I would recommend, as White, to stay away from such slightly disharmonious systems. That said, as Dragon players, we are always happy to face these systems, so let's see how to react. }
